  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Facivermis yunnanicus. Evidence-informed stylization, not a specimen facsimile. Color, soft volume, exact posture and unpreserved details are interpretive. Possible pre-ocular appendages are omitted, not asserted absent. Tube composition and construction remain uncertain; the proposed animal-only asset does not claim a freely swimming or crawling lifestyle.",
    "zh": "Facivermis yunnanicus 的示意性活体复原，并非标本翻模。颜色、软组织体积及姿态为推定；未表现的眼前附肢不等于证实不存在。单独动物模型不暗示自由游泳或爬行生活方式。"
  },
